rectory","response":{"output":"Directory listing for /Users/kennedy/Projects/restapi:\nindex.html (27937 bytes)\nREADME.md (2351 bytes)"}}}],"status":"success","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:56:55.692Z","resultDisplay":{"summary":"Found 2 item(s).","files":["index.html","README.md"]},"description":".","displayName":"ReadFolder","renderOutputAsMarkdown":true},{"id":"q0z5z9ik","name":"read_file","args":{"file_path":"/Users/kennedy/Projects/restapi/README.md"},"result":[{"functionResponse":{"id":"q0z5z9ik","name":"read_file","response":{"output":"# 🚀 LxREST - Modern REST Client\n\nLxREST is a lightweight, single-file, professional API client built for developers. It provides a polished UI inspired by Bruno and Hoppscotch, running entirely in your browser without the need for backends or build tools.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Project Roadmap & Progress\n\n| Phase | Description | Status |\n|-------|-------------|--------|\n| **0** | **Fondasi UI & Arsitektur** | ✅ Complete |\n| **1** | **Fitur Request Dasar** | ✅ Complete |\n| **2** | **Tabs & Editor Modular** | ✅ Complete |\n| **3** | **Authorization** | ✅ Complete |\n| **4** | **Environment Variables** | ⏳ Implementing |\n| **5** | **History** | ✅ Complete |\n| **6** | **Collections (Minimal)** | ⏳ Implementing |\n| **7** | **UX Enhancement** | ⏳ Refining |\n| **8** | **Realtime (WebSocket)** | ⏳ Planned |\n| **9** | **Final Release** | ⏳ In Progress |\n\n---\n\n## 🛠 Features\n\n### 1. Request Management\n- **Method Support**: GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, HEAD, OPTIONS.\n- **Modular Editors**: Dedicated tabs for Query Parameters, Headers, and Body.\n- **Authorization**: Built-in support for Bearer Tokens and Basic Auth.\n- **Environment Variables**: Use `{{variable}}` syntax to manage different environments (Dev/Staging/Prod).\n\n### 2. Response Analysis\n- **Meta Info**: Real-time display of Status Codes, Response Time (ms), and Payload Size (bytes).\n- **Body Viewer**: Auto JSON pretty-printing.\n- **HTML Preview**: Live iframe rendering for HTML responses.\n- **Header Viewer**: Inspect full response headers.\n\n### 3. Productivity & UX\n- **Sidebar History**: Automatically saves your recent requests.\n- **Collections**: Save favorite requests for quick access.\n- **Copy as cURL**: Generate cURL commands instantly.\n- **JSON Beautifier**: One-click formatting for request bodies.\n- **Offline First**: Works entirely via LocalStorage; no data leaves your machine except to your API.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Getting Started\n\nSimply open `index.html` in any modern web browser. No installation required.\n\n### Keyboard Shortcuts\n- `Ctrl/Cmd + Enter`: Send Request\n- `Ctrl/Cmd + B`: Beautify JSON Body\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 Theme: Bruno\nThe application uses a custom-tailored **Bruno Palette**:\n- **Primary**: `#6C63FF`\n- **Background**: `#0F172A`\n- **Panel**: `#1E293B`\n- **Text**: `#F1F5F9`\n\n---\n\n## 📜 License\nMIT - Use it, extend it, build with it.\n"}}}],"status":"success","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:56:55.692Z","resultDisplay":"","description":"README.md","displayName":"ReadFile","renderOutputAsMarkdown":true},{"id":"4tlu12mc","name":"read_file","args":{"file_path":"/Users/kennedy/Projects/restapi/index.html"},"result":[{"functionResponse":{"id":"4tlu12mc","name":"read_file","response":{"output":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>LxREST | Modern REST Client</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bruno-primary: #6C63FF;\n      --bruno-primary-dark: #4F46E5;\n      --bruno-primary-darker: #4338CA;\n      --bruno-bg: #0F172A;\n      --bruno-panel: #1E293B;\n      --bruno-border: #334155;\n      --bruno-text: #F1F5F9;\n      --bruno-text-secondary: #CBD5E1;\n      --bruno-text-muted: #94A3B8;\n      --bruno-success: #22C55E;\n      --bruno-warning: #FACC15;\n      --bruno-error: #EF4444;\n      --radius: 12px;\n      --shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n      background-color: var(--bruno-bg);\n      color: var(--bruno-text);\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    /* Layout */\n    .app-container {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;\n      height: 100vh;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n      .app-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .sidebar { display: none; }\n    }\n\n    /* Sidebar */\n    .sidebar {\n      background: var(--bruno-panel);\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-tabs {\n      display: flex;\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-tab {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 12px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      color: var(--bruno-text-muted);\n      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-tab.active {\n      color: var(--bruno-primary);\n      border-bottom-color: var(--bruno-primary);\n      background: rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-content {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .list-item {\n      padding: 10px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .list-item:hover {\n      background: var(--bruno-bg);\n      border-color: var(--bruno-border);\n    }\n\n    .list-item .method {\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      min-width: 45px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: var(--bruno-border);\n    }\n\n    .list-item .title {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--bruno-text-secondary);\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n\n    /* Main Content */\n    main {\n      padding: 24px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .brand { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .brand span { color: var(--bruno-primary); }\n\n    /* Panels */\n    .panel {\n      background: var(--bruno-panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .panel-header {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .panel-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--bruno-text-muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n\n    /* Controls */\n    .request-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    select, input, textarea {\n      background: var(--bruno-bg);\n      border: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      color: var(--bruno-text);\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    select:focus, input:focus, textarea:focus {\n      border-color: var(--bruno-primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    .method-select { width: 110px; font-weight: 600; }\n    .url-input { flex: 1; }\n\n    button {\n      background: var(--bruno-primary);\n      color: white;\n      border: none;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    button:hover { background: var(--bruno-primary-dark); }\n    button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }\n    button:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }\n\n    button.secondary {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      color: var(--bruno-text-secondary);\n    }\n    button.secondary:hover { background: var(--bruno-bg); border-color: var(--bruno-primary); }\n\n    /* Tabs */\n    .tabs {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 4px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .tab {\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: var(--bruno-text-muted);\n      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n      margin-bottom: -1px;\n    }\n\n    .tab.active {\n      color: var(--bruno-primary);\n      border-bottom-color: var(--bruno-primary);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .tab-content { display: none; padding-top: 8px; }\n    .tab-content.active { display: block; }\n\n    /* Key Value List */\n    .kv-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .kv-row input { flex: 1; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; }\n\n    /* Response Meta */\n    .response-meta {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 16px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n\n    .status-badge {\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .status-ok { background: #10b98122; color: var(--bruno-success); }\n    .status-err { background: #ef444422; color: var(--bruno-error); }\n\n    pre {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 16px;\n      background: var(--bruno-bg);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--bruno-border);\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      max-height: 500px;\n      color: var(--bruno-text-secondary);\n    }\n\n    .preview-frame {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 400px;\n      background: white;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: none;\n    }\n\n    /* Environment Badge */\n    .env-badge {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      background: var(--bruno-primary);\n      color: white;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      margin-left: 10px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    /* WebSocket Panel */\n    .ws-log {\n      height: 300px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      background: var(--bruno-bg);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 12px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .ws-msg { margin-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding-bottom: 2px; }\n    .ws-in { color: var(--bruno-success); }\n    .ws-out { color: var(--bruno-primary); }\n    .ws-sys { color: var(--bruno-text-muted); font-style: italic; }\n\n    /* Toast */\n    #toast {\n      position: fixed;\n      bottom: 24px;\n      right: 24px;\n      background: var(--bruno-primary);\n      color: white;\n      padding: 12px 24px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n      transform: translateY(100px);\n      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.18, 0.89, 0.32, 1.28);\n      z-index: 1000;\n    }\n\n    #toast.show { transform: translateY(0); }\n\n    .hidden { display: none; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app-container\">\n  <!-- Sidebar -->\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"sidebar-tabs\">\n      <div class=\"sidebar-tab active\" data-side=\"history\">History</div>\n      <div class=\"sidebar-tab\" data-side=\"collections\">Collections</div>\n      <div class=\"sidebar-tab\" data-side=\"env\">Env</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"sidebar-content\" id=\"sideContent\">\n      <!-- Dynamic content -->\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"padding: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--bruno-border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\">\n       <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"font-size: 10px; padding: 4px 8px;\" onclick=\"clearSidebar()\">Clear All</button>\n       <span style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--bruno-text-muted);\">v1.0.0 Final</span>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <!-- Main -->\n  <main id=\"restClient\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">Lx<span>REST</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\">\n        <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"saveToCollection()\">Save Request</button>\n        <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"copyAsCurl()\">cURL</button>\n        <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"toggleWebSocket()\">WebSocket Mode</button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Request Panel -->\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"request-bar\">\n        <select id=\"method\" class=\"method-select\">\n          <option value=\"GET\">GET</option>\n          <option value=\"POST\">POST</option>\n          <option value=\"PUT\">PUT</option>\n          <option value=\"PATCH\">PATCH</option>\n          <option value=\"DELETE\">DELETE</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"url\" class=\"url-input\" placeholder=\"https://api.example.com/endpoint\" spellcheck=\"false\">\n        <button id=\"sendBtn\">Send</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tabs\">\n        <div class=\"tab active\" data-target=\"paramsTab\">Params</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\" data-target=\"headersTab\">Headers</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\" data-target=\"bodyTab\">Body</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\" data-target=\"authTab\">Auth</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"paramsTab\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n        <div id=\"paramsList\"></div>\n        <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px;\" onclick=\"addKVRow('paramsList')\">+ Add Param</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"headersTab\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <div id=\"headersList\"></div>\n        <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px;\" onclick=\"addKVRow('headersList')\">+ Add Header</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"bodyTab\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <textarea id=\"body\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 180px; font-family: monospace;\" placeholder='{\"key\": \"value\"}' spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;\">\n          <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\" onclick=\"beautifyJSON()\">Beautify JSON</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"authTab\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n          <div>\n            <label style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--bruno-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase;\">Type</label>\n            <select id=\"authType\" onchange=\"toggleAuthFields()\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 4px;\">\n              <option value=\"none\">None</option>\n              <option value=\"bearer\">Bearer Token</option>\n              <option value=\"basic\">Basic Auth</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"authBearer\" class=\"hidden\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"bearerToken\" placeholder=\"Token\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"authBasic\" class=\"hidden\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"basicUser\" placeholder=\"Username\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n              <input type=\"password\" id=\"basicPass\" placeholder=\"Password\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Response Panel -->\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">Response</div>\n        <div class=\"response-meta\" id=\"responseMeta\">\n          <span id=\"statusLabel\" class=\"status-badge hidden\"></span>\n          <span id=\"timeLabel\" class=\"hidden\"></span>\n          <span id=\"sizeLabel\" class=\"hidden\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tabs\">\n        <div class=\"tab active\" data-target=\"respBodyTab\">Body</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\" data-target=\"respHeadersTab\">Headers</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\" data-target=\"respPreviewTab\">Preview</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"respBodyTab\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n        <pre id=\"responseBody\">// Waiting for request...</pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"respHeadersTab\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <pre id=\"responseHeaders\">// No headers</pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"respPreviewTab\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <iframe id=\"previewFrame\" class=\"preview-frame\"></iframe>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- WebSocket Panel (Hidden by default) -->\n  <main id=\"wsClient\" class=\"hidden\">\n     <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">Lx<span>WS</span></div>\n      <button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"toggleWebSocket()\">REST Mode</button>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n       <div class=\"request-bar\">\n         <input type=\"text\" id=\"wsUrl\" class=\"url-input\" placeholder=\"wss://echo.websocket.org\" value=\"wss://echo.websocket.org\">\n         <button id=\"wsConnectBtn\" onclick=\"wsConnect()\">Connect</button>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"ws-log\" id=\"wsLog\">\n         <div class=\"ws-sys\">Disconnected</div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"request-bar\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n         <input type=\"text\" id=\"wsMsg\" class=\"url-input\" placeholder=\"Message to send...\">\n         <button id=\"wsSendBtn\" onclick=\"wsSend()\" disabled>Send</button>\n       </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"toast\">Message</div>\n\n<script>\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  \n  // State\n  let history = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lxrest_history') || '[]');\n  let collections = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lxrest_collections') || '[]');\n  let environments = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lxrest_env') || '{\"Default\":{}}');\n  let currentEnv = localStorage.getItem('lxrest_current_env') || 'Default';\n  let sideActive = 'history';\n  let currentController = null;\n  let ws = null;\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Initialization\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function init() {\n    setupTabs();\n    setupSidebarTabs();\n    renderSidebar();\n    addKVRow('headersList', 'Content-Type', 'application/json');\n    addKVRow('paramsList');\n    \n    $('sendBtn').onclick = executeRequest;\n    \n    // Auto-resize textareas\n    document.querySelectorAll('textarea').forEach(el => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => {\n        el.style.height = 'auto';\n        el.style.height = el.scrollHeight + 'px';\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Shortcuts\n    window.onkeydown = e => {\n      if ((e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) && e.key === 'Enter') executeRequest();\n      if ((e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) && e.key === 'b') beautifyJSON();\n    };\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Environment Replacement\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function replaceEnv(text) {\n    if (!text) return text;\n    const envData = environments[currentEnv] || {};\n    return text.replace(/\\{\\{(.*?)\\}\\}/g, (match, key) => {\n      return envData[key.trim()] !== undefined ? envData[key.trim()] : match;\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Tabs System\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function setupTabs() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(tab => {\n      tab.onclick = () => {\n        const parent = tab.closest('.tabs');\n        const container = parent.nextElementSibling.parentElement;\n        const target = tab.dataset.target;\n        parent.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n        container.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => {\n          if (c.parentElement === container) c.classList.remove('active');\n        });\n        tab.classList.add('active');\n        $(target).classList.add('active');\n      };\n    });\n  }\n\n  function setupSidebarTabs() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar-tab').forEach(tab => {\n      tab.onclick = () => {\n        document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n        tab.classList.add('active');\n        sideActive = tab.dataset.side;\n        renderSidebar();\n      };\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Sidebar Rendering\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function renderSidebar() {\n    const cont = $('sideContent');\n    cont.innerHTML = '';\n    \n    if (sideActive === 'history') {\n      if (!history.length) cont.innerHTML = '<div style=\"color:var(--bruno-text-muted); text-align:center; margin-top:20px; font-size:12px;\">No history</div>';\n      history.forEach((item, idx) => {\n        const el = createListItem(item.method, item.url, () => loadRequest(item));\n        cont.appendChild(el);\n      });\n    } else if (sideActive === 'collections') {\n      if (!collections.length) cont.innerHTML = '<div style=\"color:var(--bruno-text-muted); text-align:center; margin-top:20px; font-size:12px;\">No collections</div>';\n      collections.forEach((item, idx) => {\n        const el = createListItem(item.method, item.name || item.url, () => loadRequest(item));\n        cont.appendChild(el);\n      });\n    } else if (sideActive === 'env') {\n      renderEnvEditor(cont);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function createListItem(method, title, onclick) {\n    const el = document.createElement('div');\n    el.className = 'list-item';\n    el.innerHTML = `\n      <span class=\"method\" style=\"color: ${getMethodColor(method)}\">${method}</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">${title}</span>\n    `;\n    el.onclick = onclick;\n    return el;\n  }\n\n  function renderEnvEditor(container) {\n    const envs = Object.keys(environments);\n    let html = `<select onchange=\"switchEnv(this.value)\" style=\"width:100%; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      ${envs.map(e => `<option value=\"${e}\" ${e === currentEnv ? 'selected' : ''}>${e}</option>`).join('')}\n    </select>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px; margin-bottom:5px; color:var(--bruno-text-muted);\">VARS (JSON)</div>\n    <textarea id=\"envJson\" style=\"width:100%; height:200px; font-size:12px;\">${JSON.stringify(environments[currentEnv], null, 2)}</textarea>\n    <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"width:100%; margin-top:5px; font-size:11px;\" onclick=\"saveEnv()\">Save Environment</button>\n    <button class=\"secondary\" style=\"width:100%; margin-top:5px; font-size:11px;\" onclick=\"addEnv()\">+ New Environment</button>`;\n    container.innerHTML = html;\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Core Network Logic\n  ----------------------------- */\n  async function executeRequest() {\n    const method = $('method').value;\n    const urlRaw = replaceEnv($('url').value.trim());\n    const bodyRaw = replaceEnv($('body').value.trim());\n    \n    if (!urlRaw) return showToast('URL is required');\n\n    const sendBtn = $('sendBtn');\n    sendBtn.disabled = true;\n    sendBtn.innerText = 'Sending...';\n    $('responseBody').innerText = '// Loading...';\n    \n    if (currentController) currentController.abort();\n    currentController = new AbortController();\n\n    const startTime = performance.now();\n    \n    try {\n      const url = new URL(urlRaw.startsWith('http') ? urlRaw : `https://${urlRaw}`);\n      const params = collectKV('paramsList');\n      Object.entries(params).forEach(([k, v]) => url.searchParams.append(replaceEnv(k), replaceEnv(v)));\n\n      const headers = collectKV('headersList');\n      // Replace env in headers\n      const finalHeaders = {};\n      Object.entries(headers).forEach(([k, v]) => finalHeaders[replaceEnv(k)] = replaceEnv(v));\n      \n      const authType = $('authType').value;\n      if (authType === 'bearer') {\n        finalHeaders['Authorization'] = `Bearer ${replaceEnv($('bearerToken').value.trim())}`;\n      } else if (authType === 'basic') {\n        const creds = btoa(`${replaceEnv($('basicUser').value)}:${replaceEnv($('basicPass').value)}`);\n        finalHeaders['Authorization'] = `Basic ${creds}`;\n      }\n\n      const options = { method, headers: finalHeaders, signal: currentController.signal };\n      if (!['GET', 'HEAD'].includes(method) && bodyRaw) options.body = bodyRaw;\n\n      const response = await fetch(url, options);\n      const duration = Math.round(performance.now() - startTime);\n      const text = await response.text();\n      const size = new TextEncoder().encode(text).length;\n\n      renderResponse(response, text, duration, size);\n      saveToHistory(method, url.toString());\n      \n    } catch (err) {\n      if (err.name === 'AbortError') return;\n      $('responseBody').innerText = `// Error: ${err.message}`;\n      showToast('Network Error');\n    } finally {\n      sendBtn.disabled = false;\n      sendBtn.innerText = 'Send';\n    }\n  }\n\n  function renderResponse(res, text, duration, size) {\n    const sl = $('statusLabel');\n    sl.innerText = `${res.status} ${res.statusText}`;\n    sl.className = `status-badge ${res.ok ? 'status-ok' : 'status-err'}`;\n    sl.classList.remove('hidden');\n    $('timeLabel').innerText = `${duration}ms`;\n    $('timeLabel').classList.remove('hidden');\n    $('sizeLabel').innerText = formatSize(size);\n    $('sizeLabel').classList.remove('hidden');\n\n    try {\n      const json = JSON.parse(text);\n      $('responseBody').innerText = JSON.stringify(json, null, 2);\n    } catch {\n      $('responseBody').innerText = text || '// Empty body';\n    }\n\n    let hStr = '';\n    res.headers.forEach((v, k) => hStr += `${k}: ${v}\\n`);\n    $('responseHeaders').innerText = hStr || '// No headers';\n\n    const ct = res.headers.get('content-type') || '';\n    if (ct.includes('text/html')) $('previewFrame').srcdoc = text;\n    else $('previewFrame').srcdoc = '<html><body style=\"background:#0F172A; color:#94A3B8; font-family:sans-serif; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:100vh;\">Preview only for HTML</body></html>';\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Save/Load State\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function saveToHistory(method, url) {\n    const item = { method, url, timestamp: Date.now() };\n    if (history[0]?.url === url && history[0]?.method === method) return;\n    history.unshift(item);\n    history = history.slice(0, 30);\n    localStorage.setItem('lxrest_history', JSON.stringify(history));\n    if (sideActive === 'history') renderSidebar();\n  }\n\n  function saveToCollection() {\n    const name = prompt('Request Name:', $('url').value);\n    if (!name) return;\n    const item = { \n      name, \n      method: $('method').value, \n      url: $('url').value, \n      body: $('body').value,\n      headers: collectKV('headersList'),\n      params: collectKV('paramsList')\n    };\n    collections.unshift(item);\n    localStorage.setItem('lxrest_collections', JSON.stringify(collections));\n    showToast('Saved to Collections');\n    if (sideActive === 'collections') renderSidebar();\n  }\n\n  function loadRequest(item) {\n    $('method').value = item.method;\n    $('url').value = item.url;\n    $('body').value = item.body || '';\n    if (item.params) {\n      $('paramsList').innerHTML = '';\n      Object.entries(item.params).forEach(([k, v]) => addKVRow('paramsList', k, v));\n    }\n    if (item.headers) {\n      $('headersList').innerHTML = '';\n      Object.entries(item.headers).forEach(([k, v]) => addKVRow('headersList', k, v));\n    }\n    showToast('Request loaded');\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Environment Logic\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function switchEnv(name) {\n    currentEnv = name;\n    localStorage.setItem('lxrest_current_env', name);\n    renderSidebar();\n  }\n\n  function saveEnv() {\n    try {\n      environments[currentEnv] = JSON.parse($('envJson').value);\n      localStorage.setItem('lxrest_env', JSON.stringify(environments));\n      showToast('Environment Saved');\n    } catch { showToast('Invalid JSON'); }\n  }\n\n  function addEnv() {\n    const name = prompt('Environment Name:');\n    if (!name) return;\n    environments[name] = {};\n    switchEnv(name);\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     WebSocket Logic\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function toggleWebSocket() {\n    $('restClient').classList.toggle('hidden');\n    $('wsClient').classList.toggle('hidden');\n  }\n\n  function wsConnect() {\n    const url = $('wsUrl').value;\n    if (ws) ws.close();\n    ws = new WebSocket(url);\n    wsLog('Connecting to ' + url, 'sys');\n    ws.onopen = () => { wsLog('Connected', 'sys'); $('wsConnectBtn').innerText = 'Disconnect'; $('wsSendBtn').disabled = false; };\n    ws.onclose = () => { wsLog('Disconnected', 'sys'); $('wsConnectBtn').innerText = 'Connect'; $('wsSendBtn').disabled = true; ws = null; };\n    ws.onmessage = (e) => wsLog(e.data, 'in');\n    ws.onerror = (e) => wsLog('Error: ' + e.message, 'sys');\n  }\n\n  function wsSend() {\n    const msg = $('wsMsg').value;\n    if (ws && ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {\n      ws.send(msg);\n      wsLog(msg, 'out');\n      $('wsMsg').value = '';\n    }\n  }\n\n  function wsLog(msg, type) {\n    const div = document.createElement('div');\n    div.className = `ws-msg ws-${type}`;\n    div.innerText = `[${new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}] ${msg}`;\n    $('wsLog').appendChild(div);\n    $('wsLog').scrollTop = $('wsLog').scrollHeight;\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     KV Row Helper\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function addKVRow(listId, key = '', value = '') {\n    const row = document.createElement('div');\n    row.className = 'kv-row';\n    row.innerHTML = `<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Key\" value=\"${key}\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Value\" value=\"${value}\"><button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\">×</button>`;\n    $(listId).appendChild(row);\n  }\n\n  function collectKV(listId) {\n    const res = {};\n    document.querySelectorAll(`#${listId} .kv-row`).forEach(row => {\n      const inputs = row.querySelectorAll('input');\n      if (inputs[0].value) res[inputs[0].value] = inputs[1].value;\n    });\n    return res;\n  }\n\n  /* -----------------------------\n     Utility\n  ----------------------------- */\n  function beautifyJSON() {\n    try {\n      const b = $('body');\n      b.value = JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(b.value), null, 2);\n    } catch { showToast('Invalid JSON'); }\n  }\n\n  function copyAsCurl() {\n    const method = $('method').value;\n    const url = $('url').value;\n    const headers = collectKV('headersList');\n    let curl = `curl -X ${method} \"${url}\"`;\n    Object.entries(headers).forEach(([k, v]) => curl += ` -H \"${k}: ${v}\"`);\n    const body = $('body').value.trim();\n    if (body && method !== 'GET') curl += ` -d '${body.replace(/'/g, \"'\\\\''\")}'`;\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(curl).then(() => showToast('cURL copied!'));\n  }\n\n  function showToast(m) {\n    const t = $('toast'); t.innerText = m; t.classList.add('show');\n    setTimeout(() => t.classList.remove('show'), 3000);\n  }\n\n  function formatSize(b) {\n    if (b < 1024) return b + ' B';\n    if (b < 1048576) return (b/1024).toFixed(1) + ' KB';\n    return (b/1048576).toFixed(1) + ' MB';\n  }\n\n  function getMethodColor(m) {\n    return { GET: '#10b981', POST: '#6C63FF', PUT: '#fbbf24', PATCH: '#a855f7', DELETE: '#ef4444' }[m] || '#94A3B8';\n  }\n\n  function clearSidebar() {\n    if (confirm('Clear ' + sideActive + '?')) {\n      if (sideActive === 'history') history = [];\n      else if (sideActive === 'collections') collections = [];\n      localStorage.setItem(`lxrest_${sideActive}`, '[]');\n      renderSidebar();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function toggleAuthFields() {\n    const type = $('authType').value;\n    $('authBearer').classList.toggle('hidden', type !== 'bearer');\n    $('authBasic').classList.toggle('hidden', type !== 'basic');\n  }\n\n  init();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}],"status":"success","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:56:55.692Z","resultDisplay":"","description":"index.html","displayName":"ReadFile","renderOutputAsMarkdown":true}]}
{"id":"4bdb7676-6922-4e93-9bf0-26dbcf9c36bb","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:57:07.536Z","type":"gemini","content":"I have scanned the codebase for **LxREST**. The project is a single-file, modern REST client built with HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JS.\n\n### 🔍 Codebase Overview\n- **`index.html`**: Contains the entire application (UI, Styles, and Logic).\n- **`README.md`**: Outlines the project roadmap and features.\n\n### 📋 Current Status vs. Roadmap\nBased on my analysis of `index.html`:\n1.  **Environment Variables (Phase 4)**: Mostly implemented. The `replaceEnv` function supports `{{variable}}` syntax in URLs, Bodies, Headers, Params, and Auth fields.\n2.  **Collections (Phase 6)**: Implemented but \"Minimal.\" It currently saves Method, URL, Body, Headers, and Params, but **does not yet save or restore Authorization settings**.\n3.  **WebSocket (Phase 8)**: Marked as \"Planned\" in the README, but basic functionality (Connect, Send, Log) is **already implemented** in the code and can be toggled via the UI.\n4.  **UX Enhancement (Phase 7)**: Ongoing. Uses a \"Bruno\" inspired dark theme.\n\n### 🛠 Observations & Potential Improvements\n- **Key-Value Overwriting**: The `collectKV` function uses a standard object, meaning if you have multiple Parameters or Headers with the same key, only the last one is sent.\n- **Collection Persistence**: Auth settings (Bearer Token, Basic Auth) are currently lost when saving/loading from Collections.\n- **Single File**: The file is ~750 lines. While manageable, it's becoming dense.\n\nHow would you like to proceed? I can help with:\n1.  **Fixing the Collections** to include Authorization settings.\n2.  **Refining the WebSocket** implementation.\n3.  **Adding support for multiple identical keys** in Params/Headers.\n4.  **Implementing any specific feature** from the \"Implementing\" or \"Planned\" list.","thoughts":[{"subject":"Analyzing the Codebase","description":"I've been reviewing the codebase, and it's quite straightforward. The project is a single-file HTML application, `index.html`, which is a REST client named LxREST, as well as a `README.md`. I am making note of its core functionality, which includes request management and modular editors for various aspects.","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:56:58.401Z"},{"subject":"Examining the WebSocket","description":"I've discovered a discrepancy – the codebase has WebSocket logic despite the roadmap listing it as \"Planned\". The `wsClient` element is present, and initial WebSocket functionality is evident. I will begin to check if this is the only discrepancy from the README.","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:56:59.626Z"},{"subject":"Assessing Current State","description":"I'm now focusing on discrepancies between the roadmap and implementation, starting with a bug hunt. I've noted a few code areas, like `saveToCollection` and `clearSidebar`, and am taking a closer look at the environment variable implementation, phase 4. The `replaceEnv` function appears robust, and is used extensively. However, the collection feature, Phase 6, is minimal. It doesn't save Auth settings.","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:57:01.067Z"},{"subject":"Evaluating the Collection Functionality","description":"I'm now diving deeper into the collection features. I've examined how requests are saved and loaded. While requests save the method, URL, body, headers, and parameters, I've noted that the authentication settings are missing in both the save and load processes. This gap needs immediate attention.","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:57:02.110Z"},{"subject":"Clarifying Discrepancies","description":"I've confirmed that the roadmap indicates WebSocket functionality is planned for Phase 8, but it's partially implemented. Functions like `toggleWebSocket`, `wsConnect`, and `wsSend` are present. I've also checked and can confirm that only `index.html` and `README.md` are present. I then did a quick check of the code, and found `collectKV`, `executeRequest`, and `beautifyJSON` use `document.querySelectorAll`, `fetch`, and `JSON.parse`/`JSON.stringify`, respectively. The `replaceEnv` function is used on keys and values in `executeRequest`. Now, I need direction!","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:57:04.438Z"}],"tokens":{"input":19806,"output":428,"cached":8141,"thoughts":1412,"tool":0,"total":21646},"model":"gemini-3-flash-preview"}
